    "body": "Maintainer decision (question dialog, 2026-11-25): this design record also settles #3934, the shape of the passes on an Outside start.\n\nPut these in the record:\n- The two designs of #3934: the Adaptive air plan on each Outside start, or the own ring set with a new chain order and link law.\n- The readings of the held work: 35 lifts on the disc fixture, and 22 lifts with 24 crossing feeds on the dog bone.\n- A check of each design against the laws of #4023. One law says that the start side changes only the order and the start point.\n- The effect of each design in words that a user of the program understands, with one recommendation.\n",
